From cb944ee9c178f7a717e904ddbf85aac5b27a2eac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rpm-build <rpm-build>
Date: Fri, 17 Apr 2026 14:52:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] verifier: Implement graceful shutdown

Implement graceful shutdown, cancel pending retries, and drain in-flight
work.

Backported from https://github.com/keylime/keylime/pull/1869

Signed-off-by: Anderson Toshiyuki Sasaki <ansasaki@redhat.com>
